/P 32 0 R
/E (A private-label health and beauty brand \(Rivia Hair Care\) operating on Shopify. The store was in its initial launch phase, operating with a solo founder managing product sourcing, custom branding, and customer fulfillment. Like many early-stage e-commerce ventures, the business had no formal financial tracking or automated operational systems in place, leading to data silos.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
